<%- include('partials/head') %>
<div class="container narrow">
  <div class="report-head">
    <span class="kicker">The guide</span>
    <h1>How <%= site.name %> works</h1>
    <p>A free lost-and-found board for everyone at <%= site.college %>, built and run by the <%= site.poweredBy %>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="stack">
    <section class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title"><span class="menu-ico lost"><%- icon('scan-search') %></span><div><h3>If you lost something</h3><p>Let the whole campus look out for it</p></div></div>
      <ol class="small" style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:grid;gap:8px;color:var(--text-2)">
        <li>Tap <b>Report item → I lost something</b>, describe it and add a photo if you have one.</li>
        <li>Everyone with alerts on is notified. Share the post on your class WhatsApp group too.</li>
        <li>If someone has it, they tap <b>I found this</b> and you get a notification.</li>
        <li>Tap <b>It's mine — share numbers</b>. You both see each other's mobile number, so call or WhatsApp to meet.</li>
        <li>Got it back? Tap <b>I got it back!</b> to close the post.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title"><span class="menu-ico found"><%- icon('hand-heart') %></span><div><h3>If you found something</h3><p>Help it get back to its owner</p></div></div>
      <ol class="small" style="margin:0;padding-left:20px;display:grid;gap:8px;color:var(--text-2)">
        <li>Tap <b>Report item → I found something</b>, take a photo and say where it is now: with you, or deposited at a collection point.</li>
        <li>Add a <b>secret detail</b> only the real owner would know. Only you and admins can see it.</li>
        <li>The owner taps <b>This is mine</b> and describes it. If it matches, confirm, and numbers are shared.</li>
        <li>Hand it over (ask to see their college ID), then mark it <b>Returned</b>.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <div class="trust" style="margin-top:16px">
      <div class="panel trust-item"><span class="t-ico"><%- icon('lock') %></span><div><b>Private by default</b><span>Numbers are only shown to the two people in a confirmed match.</span></div></div>
      <div class="panel trust-item"><span class="t-ico"><%- icon('hourglass') %></span><div><b>Auto-close</b><span>Lost posts close after <%= config.LOST_EXPIRY_DAYS %> days, found posts after <%= config.FOUND_EXPIRY_DAYS %>. You get a reminder first and can extend <%= config.MAX_EXTENSIONS %>×.</span></div></div>
      <div class="panel trust-item"><span class="t-ico"><%- icon('shield-check') %></span><div><b>Moderated</b><span>Admins can close or remove posts that break the rules. Never pay anyone to "return" an item.</span></div></div>
    </div>

    <section class="panel">
      <div class="panel-title"><span class="step-num"><%- icon('smartphone') %></span><div><h3>Alerts on iPhone</h3><p>One-time setup</p></div></div>
      <p class="small" style="margin:0;color:var(--text-2)">Open this site in Safari, tap <b>Share → Add to Home Screen</b>, open it from your home screen, then turn on alerts from your profile. On Android and laptops, just tap <b>Turn on alerts</b>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
